sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Workload owner
    participant G as Group controller
    participant A0 as Node agent rank 0
    participant A1 as Node agent rank 1
    participant S as Artifact storage

    O->>G: Create PodSetSnapshot with every member and deadline
    G->>G: Pin membership and validate the set
    par Admit rank 0 without crossing its destructive boundary
        G->>A0: Create held capture leaf
        A0-->>G: Admitted or Refused
    and Admit rank 1 without crossing its destructive boundary
        G->>A1: Create held capture leaf
        A1-->>G: Admitted or Refused
    end
    alt Any member refuses or deadline expires
        G->>A0: Abandon admitted work
        G->>A1: Abandon admitted work
        G-->>O: Set Failed before destructive capture
    else Every member is Admitted
        G->>A0: Activate capture under bounded concurrency policy
        G->>A1: Activate capture under bounded concurrency policy
        par Capture rank 0
            A0->>S: Capture and persist rank 0
            A0-->>G: Ready or Failed
        and Capture rank 1
            A1->>S: Capture and persist rank 1
            A1-->>G: Ready or Failed
        end
        Note over A0,A1: After activation, successful captures terminate source processes
        alt Every member is Ready
            G->>G: Publish PodSetSnapshotContent
            G-->>O: Set Ready
        else Any member Failed
            G-->>O: Set Failed with every member outcome
            Note over O,G: No atomicity, rollback, or group-wide fencing
        end
    end
